    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1733166057\" width=600 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1733166057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1733166057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/818b6e22971f082e181933e32205e61a.avif?t=1733166057\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Embark on the world of elite snipers with 'Seek &amp; Sniper.' Assuming the role of a rookie sniper, you'll find yourself facing challenging missions that will test your target identification and elimination skills.<br><br>Here, you don't just aim and shoot; every shot is a critical decision. The need to identify your targets based on detailed descriptions before they escape or harm another victim and eliminate them with a single precise shot makes each mission a complex puzzle.<br><br>Customization is the key to standing out in this world of precision, with a wide variety of precision rifles at your disposal. You can enhance your weapons to fit your gameplay style by adjusting aspects such as ammunition speed, accuracy, and more.<br><br>Prepare to become a master in the art of precision shooting, where every shot counts. Your journey will take you through a variety of challenging scenarios, from bustling urban landscapes to remote and unknown environments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect the clues and find the target</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/210fc057bcea0a6014988046150d6b96.poster.avif?t=1733166057\" width=600 height=425 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596930/extras/210fc057bcea0a6014988046150d6b96.webm?t=1733166057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
